---
import Eyebrow from '../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-surface-subtle border-b border-borderMuted relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <Eyebrow text="THE TIWARI PHILOSOPHY" />
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tight font-bold text-ink leading-[1.02]">
          Details make the difference.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6 text-ink-muted font-body text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Architectural aluminium and glass work is never merely about cutting profiles and slotting panels. It is about how a 12-foot sliding sash glides with quiet poise, how a flush threshold keeps torrential Pune monsoon rains out, and how hairline frame joints align with interior ceiling lines.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink/75">
          We treat each project as a tailored architectural commission — taking time at the site-assessment stage, recommending genuine material configurations, and executing with millimeter precision.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="/approach" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-gold hover:text-gold-dark font-bold transition-colors">
            <span>Learn how we manage each stage</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
